Origin
------

OpenAudioHub is based on Riffado v0.6.4 (commit 712e74f), an AGPL-3.0
project created by Perier and maintained by the Riffado community. The
long-audio pipeline in this repository was developed in a fork of Riffado
based on upstream commit b518379. The upstream copyright notices and
license terms continue to apply to the code that came from Riffado. Its full
history is available in the upstream repository.

Some identifiers, such as the `op_` API key prefix, come from an earlier
project name, OpenPlaud. OpenAudioHub still accepts them, so existing keys
and integrations keep working.


Browser connector
-----------------

The Plaud connector browser extension can sign in to Plaud and send the
resulting token to an OpenAudioHub instance. It is a separate project,
maintained at https://github.com/riffado/connector under AGPL-3.0. This
repository does not include its code.


